        "statement": "Let $B_j$ and $E_j$ denote the Bernoulli and Euler numbers in the\nconventions\n\\[\n \\frac{z}{e^z-1}=\\sum_{j\\geq0}B_j\\frac{z^j}{j!},\\qquad\n \\frac1{\\cosh z}=\\sum_{j\\geq0}E_j\\frac{z^j}{j!}.\n\\]\nFor every integer $n\\geq1$,\n\\[\n \\det(B_{i+j}^2)_{0\\leq i,j\\leq n}<0,\n \\qquad \\det(E_{i+j}^2)_{0\\leq i,j\\leq n}>0.\n\\]\nThese are the two assertions of Sun's v5 Conjecture 3.17, p.~18.",
